      "finding": "AXIOM previously treated top-of-book quotes as sufficient for advanced liquidity/execution research, without the full available aggregated Kalshi price-level snapshot or size-aware book walk; participant prices must never vote in independent outcome forecasting. Depth failures must fail closed in the new research lanes.",
